Package: zeroserve
Title: High-Performance Inter-Process Communication and Data Serving
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Egor", "Kotov", , "kotov.egor@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6690-5345"))
Description: A high-performance, frontend-agnostic transport layer that serves
    data to browsers for use in htmlwidgets, Shiny apps, or custom web
    frontends. It provides disk-free, copy-minimized Arrow IPC transport via
    shared memory and HTTP Range requests for disk-backed files, avoiding JSON
    serialization. Arrow results are completely materialized in memory before
    a URL is returned. Specialized support is provided for DuckDB,
    DuckSpatial, sf, and Arrow objects.
